# Build artifacts
target/
dist/
node_modules/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/

# Env / secrets — .env.example documents variable names only
.env

# Docs, spec and agent-config files stay local-only for now: only source
# code is tracked at this stage. Revisit once the repo has real content.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/CLAUDE-CODE-PROMPT.md
docs/
spec/
seed/

# Kept even if docs/ tracking is turned back on later: this is the
# author's private learning map and must never reach the public repo.
docs/study/

# READMEs are local-only except the root one, which is the repo's front door.
**/README.md
!/README.md

# WSL "zone identifier" artifacts left behind by files downloaded on Windows
*:Zone.Identifier
